  ### @brief CState mode
  ### @details This value controls the Cstate Mode for the CPU Cores
  ### @li 0 - CStateModeDisabled
  ### @li 1 - CStateModeC6
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdCStateMode|1|UINT8|0x000CC001

  ### @brief CState IO base address
  ### @details IoBaseAddress = 0 to disable IoCstate and CC6
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdCStateIoBaseAddress|0x413|UINT16|0x000CC002

  ### @brief Lowest PState milli watt
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdPowerCeiling|0x0|UINT32|0x000CC003

  ### @brief Core performance boost switch
  ### @li 0 - CPB disabled
  ### @li 1 - Auto
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdCpbMode|0x1|UINT8|0x000CC004

  ### @brief Hardware Prefetch Mode
  ### <p>
  ### @see HARDWARE_PREFETCH_MODE
  ### <p>
  ### @li 0 - HARDWARE_PREFETCHER_AUTO
  ### @li 1 - DISABLE_HW_PREFETCHER_TRAINING_ON_SOFTWARE_PREFETCHES
  ### @li 2 - DISABLE_L1_PREFETCHER
  ### @li 3 - DISABLE_L2_STRIDE_PREFETCHER
  ### @li 4 - DISABLE_HARDWARE_PREFETCH
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdHardwarePrefetchMode|0|UINT8|0x000CC005

  ### @brief Software Prefetch Mode
  ### <p>
  ### @see SOFTWARE_PREFETCH_MODE
  ### <p>
  ### @li 0 - SOFTWARE_PREFETCHES_AUTO
  ### @li 1 - DISABLE_SOFTWARE_PREFETCHES
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdSoftwarePrefetchMode|0|UINT8|0x000CC006

  ### @brief Pstate Policy
  ### @li 0 - PSD is dependent or independent per processor default
  ### @li 1 - PSD is forced dependent
  ### @li 2 - PSD is forced independent
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAgesaPstatePolicy|0|UINT8|0x000CC007

  ### @brief Down core mode
  ### <p>
  ### For example, valid values for RV are 0, 1, 3, 4 <br>
  ### </p>
  ### <p>
  ### @attention Note that if down coring occurs, the system must be power cycled
  ### to restore disabled cores, or before attempting to down core further
  ### </p>
  ### @see CCX_DOWN_CORE_MODE
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdDownCoreMode|0|UINT8|0x000CC008

  ### @brief Disable/Enable SMT
  ### @li 0 - SMT disabled
  ### @li 1 - SMT Auto
  ### <p>
  ### @attention Note that once SMT has been disabled, the system must be power cycled to restore the disabled threads
  ### </p>
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdSmtMode|0x1|UINT8|0x000CC009

  ### @brief Down core for CCD
  ### @see CCD_MODE
  ### <p>
  ### @attention Note that if CCD down coring occurs, the system must be power cycled to restore disabled CCDs, or before attempting to down core further
  ### </p>
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdCcdMode|0|UINT8|0x000CC00A

#----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#-  ACPI DynamicPCDs
### Set Doxy_path: "PCD-ACPI.h"
#----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  ## Enable AGESA to generate SSDT tables
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCpuSsdt|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC00B
  ## Enable AGESA to generate CPU SSDT _PCT entry
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCpuSsdtPct|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC00C
  ## Enable AGESA to generate CPU SSDT _PSS entry
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCpuSsdtPss|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC00D
  ## Enable AGESA to generate CPU SSDT XPSS entry
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCpuSsdtXpss|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC00E
  ## Enable AGESA to generate CPU SSDT _PSD entry
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCpuSsdtPsd|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC00F
  ## Enable AGESA to generate CPU SSDT _PPC entry
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCpuSsdtPpc|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC010
  ## Enable AGESA to generate CPU C1 state entry
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCstC1|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC011
  ## Enable AGESA to generate CPU C3 state entry
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCstC3|FALSE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC012

  ## Enable AGESA to generate ACPI CRIT table
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCrat|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC013
  ## Enable AGESA to generate ACPI CDIT table
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCdit|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC014
  ## Enable AGESA to generate ACPI WHEA table
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiWhea|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC015
  ## Enable AGESA to generate ACPI SRAT table
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiSrat|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC016
  ## Enable AGESA to generate ACPI SLIT table
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiSlit|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC017
  ## Enable AGESA to generate DMI data
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAgesaDmi|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC018

  ## Dynamic PCD used to indicate whether or not the current config supports S3
  # @li TRUE - S3 can be enabled
  # @li FALSE - S3 support should be disabled
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiS3Support|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC019

  ## Enable CPU WDT
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdCpuWdtEn|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC01A

  ## CPU WDT Timout vaue
  # <p> '0xFFFF' means Auto which will use silicon reset value
  # <p> upper 8 bits - CpuWdtCountSel
  # @li 0      - 4095
  # @li 1      - 2047
  # @li 2      - 1023
  # @li 3      - 511
  # @li 4      - 255
  # @li 5      - 127
  # @li 6      - 63
  # @li 7      - 31
  # @li 8      - 8191
  # @li 9      - 16383
  # @li Others - Reserved
  # </p>
  # <p>
  # lower 8 bits - CpuWdtTimeBase
  # @li 00     - 1.31ms
  # @li 01     - 1.28us
  # @li Others - Reserved
  # </p>
  # <p>
  # @attention RESTRICTION: When both CPU WDT & DF WDT are enable, the CPU WDT timeout must be greater than or equal to the DF CCM WDT timeout limit
  # </p>
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdCpuWdtTimeout|0xFFFF|UINT16|0x000CC01B

  ## Enable L1 Stream HW Prefetcher
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdL1StreamPrefetcher|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC01C
  ## Enable L2 Stream HW Prefetcher
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdL2StreamPrefetcher|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC01D
  ## Default Perf Present Cap value for _PPC table
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCpuPerfPresentCap|0xFF|UINT8|0x000CC01E
  ## Enable AGESA to generate ACPI MCST table
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiMsct|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC01F
  ## Enable force Locks to only schedule non-speculative
  # for ZP-SP3 only
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdScnLockNEnable|FALSE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC020
  ## ACPI CSate C1 latency value
  # default is 1
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCpuCstC1Latency|0x00000001|UINT16|0x000CC021
  ## ACPI CSate C2 latency value
  # default is 18
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCpuCstC2Latency|0x00000012|UINT16|0x000CC022
  ## ACPI CSate C3 latency value
  # default is 350
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCpuCstC3Latency|0x0000015E|UINT16|0x000CC023
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCpuLpiC1MinRes|0x00000000|UINT32|0x000CC024   # RV. 0
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCpuLpiC2MinRes|0x0000003C|UINT32|0x000CC025   # RV. 60
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCpuLpiC3MinRes|0x000003E8|UINT32|0x000CC026   # RV. 1000
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCpuLpiC1WorstCaseWakeupLatency|0x00000001|UINT32|0x000CC027 # RV. 1
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCpuLpiC2WorstCaseWakeupLatency|0x00000012|UINT32|0x000CC028 # RV. 18
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCpuLpiC3WorstCaseWakeupLatency|0x0000015E|UINT32|0x000CC029 # RV. 350
  ## ACPI C3 control
  # @li 0 - Disable
  # @li 1 - CST
  # @li 2 - LPI with CST
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiC3Ctrl|0x00|UINT8|0x000CC02A

  ## Enable AGESA to generate ACPI PCCT table
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiPcct|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC02B
  ## Use a container to put CPU SSDT location
  # <p>
  # @li Processor scope in _SB container. ex. _SB.PLTF ACPI 6 required
  # @li Processor scope not in _SB container. Determined by PcdAmdAcpiCpuSsdtProcessorScopeInSb
  # </p>
  # @see PcdAmdAcpiCpuSsdtProcessorScopeInSb
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCpuSsdtProcessorContainerInSb|FALSE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC02C
  ## Processor container name in _SB scope. Must be 4 bytes. ACPI 6 required
  # Used if PcdAmdAcpiCpuSsdtProcessorContainerInSb is TRUE
  # @see PcdAmdAcpiCpuSsdtProcessorContainerInSb
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCpuSsdtProcessorContainerName|"PLTF"|VOID*|0x000CC02D
  ## Parent state for LPI C2 state in processor container.
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCpuSsdtProcessorLpiC2ParentState|0x00|UINT8|0x000CC02E
  ## Parent state for LPI C3 state in processor container.
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdAcpiCpuSsdtProcessorLpiC3ParentState|0x01|UINT8|0x000CC02F
#----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#-  CCX Dynamic PCDs
### Set Doxy_path: "PCD-CCX.h"
#----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  ### @brief CC6 Control
  ### @details This value controls whether AGESA will or disable CC6 support in the CPU Cores
  ### @li 0 - Disable CC6
  ### @li 1 - Enable CC6 at core side
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdCc6Ctrl|1|UINT8|0x000CC030

  ### @brief Enable Platform First Error Handling
  ### @details This value controls whether AGESA will or disable Platform First Error Handling
  ### @li 0 - Disable Platform Error Handling
  ### @li 1 - Enable Platform Error Handling
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdCcxCfgPFEHEnable|FALSE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC031

  ### @brief Secure Nested Paging (SNP) Memory (RMP Table) Coverage
  ### @details This value controls whether AGESA will or disable SNP
  ### @li 0 - Disabled
  ### @li 1 - Enabled (ENTIRE system memory)
  ### @li 2 - Custom (Specify System Memory Size to be covered)
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdSnpMemCover|0|UINT8|0x000CC032

  ### @brief SNP size of system memory to cover, if PcdAmdSnpMemCover is Custom @see PcdAmdSnpMemCover
  ### @details This PCD sets the size of SnpMem
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdSnpMemSize|0|UINT32|0x000CC033

  ### @brief Enable SMEE(Secure Memory Encryption Enable)
  ### @details This PCD enables SMEE it is disabled by default
  ### @li 0 - Disabled
  ### @li 1 - Enabled
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdSmee|FALSE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC035

  ### @brief Enable L1 Stride Prefetcher
  ### @details This PCD enables L1 Stride Prefetcher
  ### @li 0 - Disabled
  ### @li 1 - Enabled
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdL1StridePrefetcher|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC036

  ### @brief Enable L1 Region Prefetcher
  ### @details This PCD enables L1 Region Prefetcher
  ### @li 0 - Disabled
  ### @li 1 - Enabled
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdL1RegionPrefetcher|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC037

  ### @brief Enable L2 Up/Down Prefetcher
  ### @details This PCD enables L2 Up/Down Prefetcher
  ### @li 0 - Disabled
  ### @li 1 - Enabled
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdL2UpDownPrefetcher|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC038

  ### @brief PCD to set SmbiosTableType16->ExtendedMaximumCapacity
  ### @details PCD is set to 4TB or 8TB based on the No of Dimms per channel
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdSmbiosT16ExtMaximumCapacity|0x0000040000000000|UINT64|0x000CC039

  ### @brief Enable SMKEE(Secure Multi Key Encryption Enable)
  ### @details This PCD enables SMKEE it is disabled by default
  ### @li 0 - Disabled
  ### @li 1 - Enabled
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdSmkee|FALSE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC03A

  ### @brief PCD to enable transparent error logging
  ### @details PCD is set to TRUE to enable logging or FALSE to disable logging
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdTransparentErrorLoggingEnable|FALSE|BOOLEAN|0x000CC03B

  ### @brief The MONITOR, MWAIT, MONITORX, and MWAITX opcodes become invalid, when Enabled.
  ### @li 0 - Disabled
  ### @li 1 - Enabled
  ### @li 0xFF - Auto
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdMonMwaitDis|0xFF|UINT8|0x000CC03C

