  ### @li 2: Maximum 2 unique distances (self, not self)
  ### @li 3: Maximum 3 unique distances (self, on socket, remote socket)
  ### @li 0xFF - Auto
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdFabricSlitDegree|0xFF|UINT8|0x000DF007
  ### @endcond

  ### @cond (FF3 || RN || BA || ZP || RMB || RPL)
  ### @brief Fabric Slit 2nd degree Distance Override value
  ### @details This overrides the value of the Slit distance if the PcdAmdFabricSlitDegree is set to 2
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdFabric2ndDegreeSlitDistance|0x1C|UINT8|0x000DF008
  ### @endcond

  ### @cond (FF3 || RN || BA || ZP || RMB || RPL)
  ### @brief Fabric Slit 3rd degree Distance Override value
  ### @details This overrides the value of the Slit distance if the PcdAmdFabricSlitDegree is set to 3
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdFabric3rdDegreeSlitLocalDistance|0x10|UINT8|0x000DF009
  ### @endcond

  ### @cond (FF3 || RN || BA || ZP || RMB || RPL)
  ### @brief Fabric Remote Slit 3rd degree Distance Override value
  ### @details This overrides the value of the Remote Slit distance if the PcdAmdFabricSlitDegree is set to 3
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdFabric3rdDegreeSlitRemoteDistance|0x20|UINT8|0x000DF00A
  ### @endcond

