  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdFabricCcxAsNumaDomain|FALSE|BOOLEAN|0x000DF00B
  ### @endcond

  ### @cond (FF3 || RN || BA || ZP || RMB || RPL)
  ### @brief Fabric Use SLIT distance PCDs
  ### @details This uses the PCD values to control SLIT distances and not use the HW defaults
  ### @li 0: Use the PCDs
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdFabricSlitDistancePcdCtrl|0xFF|UINT8|0x000DF00C
  ### @endcond

  ### @cond (FF3 || RN || BA || ZP || RMB || RPL || SSP)
  ### @brief Fabric specifies the distance between two virtual domains
  ### @details if PcdAmdFabricSlitDistancePcdCtrl is zero, this value specifies the distance between two virtual domains that
