  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdFabricSlitVirtualDistance|0x0B|UINT8|0x000DF00D
  ### @endcond

  ### @cond (FF3 || RN || BA || ZP || RMB || RPL || SSP)
  ### @brief Fabric specifies the distance between two physical domains on the same socket
  ### @details if PcdAmdFabricSlitDistancePcdCtrl is zero, this value specifies the distance between two physical domains on same socket
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdFabricSlitLocalDistance|0x0C|UINT8|0x000DF00E
  ### @endcond

  ### @cond (FF3 || RN || BA || ZP || RMB || RPL || SSP)
  ### @brief Fabric specifices the distance between two physical domains on the different socket
  ### @details if PcdAmdFabricSlitDistancePcdCtrl is zero, this value
  ### belong to the same physical domain specifies the distance between two physical domains on different sockets
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdFabricSlitRemoteDistance|0x20|UINT8|0x000DF00F
  ### @endcond

  ### @cond (FF3 || RN || BA || ZP || RMB || RPL || SSP)
  ### @brief Fabric specifices the distance between two domains on different sockets
  ### @details  if PcdAmdFabricSlitDistancePcdCtrl is non-zero, this boolean switches between setting a value of 2.8 or 3.2 is reported
