  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdFabricSlitAutoRemoteFar|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000DF010
  ### @endcond


  ### @cond (FF3 || RN || BA || ZP || RMB || RPL || SSP)
  ### @brief Fabric SLIT SLINK Local Distance
