  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdEspiIrqPolarity|0x00000000|UINT32|0x000A6008
  ### @endcond

  ### @cond (Huashan || Keith || Shasta || Tacoma || Yuntai)
