  ### @brief Turn off XTAL during S3/S5
  ### @details Turn off XTAL during S3/S5
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdTurnOffXtalS3S5|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x000A600D
  ### @endcond

  ### @cond (Huashan || Keith || Shasta || Tacoma || Yuntai)
