  ### @cond (RV || RMB || RN || RPL || PHX)
  ### @brief Allows the host BIOS to set the PCI Sub-System ID value reported by the iGPU audio controller.
  ### This is nBIF Function 1 for Family 17h processors. A value of zero will indicate that the normal hardware
  ### fused value should be used.
