  ### @brief System TPM config Value
  ### @detail System TPM config Value, SBIOS needs to set the value in PEI phase.
  ### @li 0x0:  dTPM
  ### @li 0x1:  PSP fTPM
  ### @li 0x2:  HSP fTPM
  ### @li 0xFF: no TPM
