  ### @li FALSE: system will not be powered off forcibly when intrusion is detected
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdPspPowerOffSystemIfIntrusionDetected|FALSE|BOOLEAN|0x95940032

