  ### @detai SOC UART Clock setting.
  ### @li 48000000: Default Value
  gEfiAmdAgesaPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdIdsUartClock|48000000|UINT32|0x00020011

  ### @brief UART BaudRate Value Setting
